  "Whole Sun, next 24 h: M flare <b style=\"color:#FFA040\">{m}%</b> · X flare <b style=\"color:#FF4444\">{x}%</b>": "Ganze Sonne, nächste 24 h: M-Flare <b style=\"color:#FFA040\">{m}%</b> · X-Flare <b style=\"color:#FF4444\">{x}%</b>",
